### get_source_directory

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl get_source_directory () =\n    run_target function\n        // Rust: the crate's directory, fixed at build time (F# substitutes the source file's directory).\n        | Rust => fun () => $'Rc::<str>::from(env\\!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\"))' : string\n        | _ => fun () => $'__SOURCE_DIRECTORY__' : string","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl get_source_directory () =
      run_target function
          // Rust: the crate's directory, fixed at build time (F# substitutes the source file's directory).
          | Rust => fun () => $'Rc::<str>::from(env\!("CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR"))' : string
          | _ => fun () => $'__SOURCE_DIRECTORY__' : string
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

