### find_parent

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"let find_parent file_type name root_dir =\n    inl is_file = file_type = File\n    inl exists_fn = if is_file then file_exists else directory_exists\n    let rec 루프 dir =\n        if dir </> name |> exists_fn\n        then dir |> Ok\n        else\n            inl parent = dir |> directory_get_parent\n            match parent |> optionm'.unbox with\n            | Some parent => parent |> 루프\n            | None =>\n                sm'.(++#) \"file_system.find_parent / No parent for \" (if is_file then \"file\" else \"dir\")\n                +. $'$\" \\'{!name}\\' at \\'{!root_dir}\\' (until \\'{!dir}\\')\"'\n                |> fun x => x : string\n                |> Error\n    root_dir |> 루프","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  let find_parent file_type name root_dir =
      inl is_file = file_type = File
      inl exists_fn = if is_file then file_exists else directory_exists
      let rec 루프 dir =
          if dir </> name |> exists_fn
          then dir |> Ok
          else
              inl parent = dir |> directory_get_parent
              match parent |> optionm'.unbox with
              | Some parent => parent |> 루프
              | None =>
                  sm'.(++#) "file_system.find_parent / No parent for " (if is_file then "file" else "dir")
                  +. $'$" \'{!name}\' at \'{!root_dir}\' (until \'{!dir}\')"'
                  |> fun x => x : string
                  |> Error
      root_dir |> 루프
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

