### new_file_uri

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl new_file_uri (path : string) : string =\n    inl path = path |> sm'.trim_start [ '/' ]\n    $'$\"file:///{!path}\"'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl new_file_uri (path : string) : string =
      inl path = path |> sm'.trim_start [ '/' ]
      $'$"file:///{!path}"'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

